      resolutionCriterion: pair("Support membership을 outcome 전에 고정하고, 보장은 support 내 조건부 위험과 support coverage를 함께 보고해야 한다. 구조적 0을 오류율 분모에서 제외하되, 실제 support 내 실패를 빠뜨리지 않았음을 독립 membership 계산으로 증명해야 한다.", "Freeze support membership before outcomes and report both conditional risk within support and support coverage. Structural zeros must be excluded from the error denominator while an independent membership calculation proves that no genuine within-support failure was omitted."),
