        link("H70-F3", "유한표본 폭을 계산한다", "Compute finite-sample width", "Cell count와 pipeline 간 일치에서 inclusion·residual interval을 만든다.", "Construct inclusion and residual intervals from cell counts and cross-pipeline agreement.", "희소 cell을 pooling하면 detector-specific failure가 가려진다.", "Pooling sparse cells can hide detector-specific failure."),
        link("H70-F4", "Target population으로 운반한다", "Transport to the target population", "실제 Cepheid의 joint support mass로 cell 결과를 재가중한다.", "Reweight cell results by the real Cepheids' joint support mass.", "관측되지 않은 regime으로 extrapolation하면 coverage 주장은 무효다.", "Extrapolation to unobserved regimes invalidates the coverage claim.")
