        hypothesis("H70-S-C", "Adaptive detector baseline의 selective error를 통제할 수 있다.", "Selective error in adaptive detector baselines can be controlled.", "허용 adaptation ledger와 fresh holdout rule 아래 simulation이 nominal error를 유지한다.", "Simulation retains nominal error under an allowed-adaptation ledger and fresh-holdout rule.", "남은 detector와 version branch를 포함한 adaptation replay를 실행한다.", "Run an adaptation replay including remaining detectors and version branches.", "Adaptation replay와 새 holdout 판정을 실행하지 않아 selective error 통제는 미검증이다.", "Selective error control remains unverified because adaptation replay and fresh-holdout adjudication have not run.")
